    "en": {
      "type": "Archive Essay",
      "title": "Retrieving Chl-a Is Not Retrieving Phytoplankton Biomass",
      "tags": [
        "Ocean Color",
        "Retrieval",
        "Evidence"
      ],
      "read": "4 min",
      "excerpt": "The satellite product may be chlorophyll-a; the paper may discuss biomass. The missing step between them is an ecological representation relation, not part of the retrieval itself.",
